isit a facility displaying the safe place sign to request help such as reconnecting with a parent guardian or finding shelter statewide statewide crisis response hotline transportation for endangered people youth shelters runaway homeless youth helplines youth people experiencing homelessness', 'friendsofyouth.org', 0, 0, 'safe-place-crisis-response-hotline-statewide-26891025');
